    "# ── 11. Aggregate & Export (Strict Gates) ─────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# Applies the quality gate and exports the final benchmark dataset.\n",
    "#\n",
    "# Quality gate (all conditions must be True for a template to be included):\n",
    "#   ✅ cfn-lint:          no errors\n",
    "#   ✅ validate-template: passes\n",
